}

@Override
public boolean matches(Element root, Element element) {
    return element.hasAttr(key) && value.equalsIgnoreCase(element.attr(key).trim());
}
```

And other evaluators at lines 317, 340, 363 which also inherit from something.

Let me search for the line numbers of the constructors to see what they're passing to super().

